+7. Retrieval artifacts: SATISFIED per brief (step-2c-i Rule-A post + approval + P0 baselines on issue #352 thread).
+
+## PATCH
+`audits/rejected_patch-352-2ci.diff` was written (git apply --check green) and constrains riscv sfence_vma_asid to the explicit `sfence.vma x0, asid` form so the whole ASID is purged.
+
